  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Karamoja Nutrition Programme (KNP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Karamoja Nutrition Programme will deliver services to treat acute malnutrition; strengthen health service planning and delivery; improve access to supplements that prevent micronutrient deficiencies for mothers and children; and test and scale initiatives to prevent malnutrition in Karamoja &#x2013; including through crop bio-fortification.</narrative>
  </description>
